filter the returned gap periods to keep only those with duration > 5 days;  
for each station_id that has at least one such gap: createMaintenanceRecord(station_id=station_id, record_date="2024-02-15", notes="Data‑gap detected for Noise sensor: <list of gap periods>") → record the maintenance entry;  
finally, return a collection of {station_id, identified_gap_periods, maintenance_note} for all stations where a maintenance record was created.

